description:
Deficiency #1 + PR #336. Frozen class-progression rows carry untyped table labels and unresolved markers (subclass feature slots, improvement labels, Wizard 'Signature Spell' alias, Rogue 'Thieves Cant', Ranger spellsKnown:null) that a level-up engine cannot safely apply. Replace raw table labels with typed advancement entries:
  featureGrant: { ref }
  subclassFeatureSlot: { slotName, subclassLevel }
  featureImprovement: { targetRefs, label, rulesText? }
  choiceGrant: { kind, choose, from }
  resourceProgression: { resource, value }
  spellcastingProgression: { cantripsKnown, spellsKnown, slots, pactSlots? }
Re-freeze gate: FAIL if any class level row still has an untyped no-ref feature marker unless deliberately represented as a typed subclass slot or typed improvement; FAIL on null numeric spellcasting placeholders (e.g. Ranger spellsKnown:null).
